217+  028B              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
218+  028B              ; Guest RAM backing access
219+  028B              ;
220+  028B              ; Guest RAM allocation starts at NeoGS physical page 44h.
221+  028B              ; Guest byte address maps linearly to physical offset 110000h + guest address.
222+  028B              ; WIN3 is a permanently reserved bank aperture; its current page is volatile.
223+  028B              ; These routines do not restore WIN3's previous page because the page port is
224+  028B              ; write-only and WIN3 is owned exclusively by this memory backend.
225+  028B              ;
226+  028B              ; Entry address: x86_phys_addr = low, middle, high-nibble.
227+  028B              ; Read returns byte in A, carry clear. Non-RAM overlay regions return carry.
228+  028B              ; Write takes byte in A, carry clear on success; non-RAM returns carry.
229+  028B              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
